    "Source drawings are normalized fire plans, not as-built survey; unknown photo dates are not verified2026 appearance.",
    "Four floors/noB1/onecentralstairs fixed; internal heights, partitions, facade modules, unseen rear androof approximate.",
    "Model routes not actual human/code/net-height certification; thin details/process supports not physically printed.",
    "Four-floor connected hollow rooms/corridor/central return stairs; very thin frames, louver slats and staircase/roof slabs need support, orientation and trapped-material removal assessment. No physical print.",
