    "Reviewer mesh/native/spatial scripts executed against a fixed private copy of core9199 and scene; copy contains oldSOURCES only and is not falsely described as an archive extraction. Final core/native/fivePNG byte equality to that fixed copy independently checked.",
    "Initial bulk occupancy execution was killed by runtime memory pressure; rerun used64point chunks without changing samples. Separately15landing-boundary failures retained with explicit boundedwalkstrip resolution.",
    "Raw exact-weld topology and non-vertex-adjacent17axisSAT do not certify all shared-vertex folds. No mesh repair, discarded tiny faces or post-QA coordinate rounding.",
    "Sampled erosion and normal rays disclose thin parts; neither is a global wall-thickness/strength/printability guarantee. No physical print or slicer-toolpath certification.",
