    "Historical source and first-shape snapshots remain exact; final source ZIP independently extracted, built and fully rendered, not waived because changes were documentation-only.",
    "Main repository only read; historical source-dedup ref and later shared HEAD separately recorded. No git write/stage/commit/push by reviewer."
